{
 "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
 "$id": "gpobs/1",
 "title": "Gun-positioner observation session record (events.jsonl line)",
 "description": "Record kinds written to a session's `events.jsonl`: the observation schema.\n\nEvery record carries `kind`, `rec` (the writer's sequence number), `mono_ns`\n(host `time.monotonic_ns()` of the event) and `wall_ns`. Frames, moves, probe\nchannels and observations therefore sort onto one monotonic timeline.\n`validate()` checks a record against its kind's required fields and the types\nof any documented optional fields present; unknown kinds and missing or\nmistyped fields are errors. `json_schema()` renders the same definitions as a\nJSON Schema document (observation-schema.json beside this package).\n\nMove receipts map the controls `Client.move()` call as follows (see\n`controls.receipt_from_client_move`): move_command.issued_mono_ns is stamped\nbefore the call; move_ack.ack_mono_ns is the Client log's host receipt of the\n`ack` reply whose `op` is MOVE6 and whose sequence is the move's;\nmove_complete.complete_mono_ns is the host receipt of the first later reply\nwhose `completed_seq` is that sequence (the stamp after `move()` returned when\nno log is available); status `unverified` marks a move the Client completed\nwhose log lacks that command, ack or completion; controller_time_us is\nthe device's `completed_us`; completion_mapped_mono_ns is that device time on\nthe host clock through the clock map fitted from `clock_exchange` records,\nwith its uncertainty; reported_counts is the returned status `count`;\ndriver_state is the `drivers()` rows read after the move; controller holds\nevery other field of the returned status (state, fault, health, profile,\ncurrent_scales, configured_vsense, vsense, microsteps, max_rate, vm_epoch,\ntimer_ticks). move_ack.vm_epoch and\nmove_complete.vm_epoch carry the controller's supply epoch, so a supply cycle\nbetween two receipts, and therefore between the frames around them, is visible.",
 "oneOf": [
  {
   "$ref": "#/$defs/session_note"
  },
  {
   "$ref": "#/$defs/camera"
  },
  {
   "$ref": "#/$defs/source_event"
  },
  {
   "$ref": "#/$defs/optics"
  },
  {
   "$ref": "#/$defs/frame"
  },
  {
   "$ref": "#/$defs/frame_gap"
  },
  {
   "$ref": "#/$defs/measurement_start"
  },
  {
   "$ref": "#/$defs/measurement_end"
  },
  {
   "$ref": "#/$defs/measurement_refused"
  },
  {
   "$ref": "#/$defs/move_command"
  },
  {
   "$ref": "#/$defs/move_ack"
  },
  {
   "$ref": "#/$defs/move_complete"
  },
  {
